{"1243550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SilkRoad Project", "steam_appid": 1243550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/e785247b44ea7cd1efd7544a6f2835e3.avif?t=1781991602\" width=1200 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/b7a4338a095473b71d8507689a50e443.poster.avif?t=1781991602\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/b7a4338a095473b71d8507689a50e443.webm?t=1781991602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/b7a4338a095473b71d8507689a50e443.mp4?t=1781991602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SILKROAD Project</strong> is a dynamic <strong>character action game</strong> that incorporates guesthouse <strong>management </strong>elements, and is made by Guedin, a <strong>solo dev</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It blends <strong>2 game genres</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense and challenging action game with <strong>complex combat mechanics</strong>, with a smart system that lets the player easily <strong>control two characters simultaneously</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>unique management game</strong> where <strong>mini-games</strong> deliver surprising <strong>depth </strong>rarely found in the genre.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of this game as a blend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/d7ba289e6645fdbddf48bf77a70aa5f1.avif?t=1781991602\" width=1200 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/ee6ef036be280d2a02380348679b5669.poster.avif?t=1781991602\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/ee6ef036be280d2a02380348679b5669.webm?t=1781991602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/ee6ef036be280d2a02380348679b5669.mp4?t=1781991602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced, Aggressive Combat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Bayonetta</i> and <i>Devil May Cry</i>, combat rewards constant pressure and aggressive play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Character Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside a spirit companion controlled in parallel to create combos, positioning plays, and crowd control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement &amp; Timing Focused</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master dodges, repositioning, and enemy reads to control the tempo of every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/78cc11d63f5fa31f5facc3ec769458c9.avif?t=1781991602\" alt=\"MANAGE A GUESTHOUSE\" width=1200 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/bf203066b36abb6b3d06edc4eda5aa82.poster.avif?t=1781991602\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/bf203066b36abb6b3d06edc4eda5aa82.webm?t=1781991602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/bf203066b36abb6b3d06edc4eda5aa82.mp4?t=1781991602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Routine</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start each day by welcoming a new guest, negotiating their stay, then talking with them to understand their needs and desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Management</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your day efficiently and end it with a good meal that grants buffs and debuffs for the following day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guest Satisfaction</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more satisfied a guest is with their stay, the greater your rewards: larger tips, new skills, and reputation gained through word of mouth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/12d32f9788e378ae0af0998103c81b32.avif?t=1781991602\" width=1200 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/861790993f20fa507014bdce2e89c07b.poster.avif?t=1781991602\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/861790993f20fa507014bdce2e89c07b.webm?t=1781991602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/861790993f20fa507014bdce2e89c07b.mp4?t=1781991602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Variety</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mini-game introduces classic mechanics, reimagined through unexpected situations tied to guesthouse management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Gameplay, Unique Situations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish as if you were fighting in a turn-based battle, cook by combining flavors like a Match-3 game, or entertain guests by using a card deck to build captivating stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guest Synergy</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests can join activities to improve outcomes and unlock unique bonuses.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/e785247b44ea7cd1efd7544a6f2835e3.avif?t=1781991602\" width=1200 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/b7a4338a095473b71d8507689a50e443.poster.avif?t=1781991602\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/b7a4338a095473b71d8507689a50e443.webm?t=1781991602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s