\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guest Synergy</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests can join activities to improve outcomes and unlock unique bonuses.</p>", "short_description": "SILKROAD Project blends a dynamic combat system, where player control two characters simultaneously, with guesthouse management gameplay, featuring unique mini-games and activities. Plan your day by welcoming guests, organizing your routine, and defending your caravanserai to keep it thriving.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/c7b1b2b8dfce8fddda03339ba03dd1267fe6dc1b/header.jpg?t=1781991602", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/d57165f8027e08411d7bf1cfaf12db5b1ab735bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781991602", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/d57165f8027e08411d7bf1cfaf12db5b1ab735bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781991602", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GTX 960</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GTX 1060</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Guedin"], "publishers": ["Guedin"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "descripti